<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Rentora Email Verification</title>
</head>

<body style="
margin:0;
padding:0;
background:#0b0f19;
font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="padding:40px 0;">
<tr>
<td align="center">


<table width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="
background:#111827;
border-radius:18px;
overflow:hidden;
border:1px solid #1f2937;
">


<!-- TOP -->
<tr>
<td style="
height:5px;
background:#22c55e;
"></td>
</tr>



<!-- LOGO -->
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:35px 30px 15px;">

<h1 style="
margin:0;
font-size:32px;
font-weight:800;
color:#ffffff;
">
🏠 Rentora
</h1>

<p style="
margin:10px 0 0;
font-size:13px;
color:#94a3b8;
">
Secure real estate platform
</p>

</td>
</tr>





<!-- ICON -->
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:20px;">

<div style="
width:90px;
height:90px;
background:#14532d;
border-radius:50%;
line-height:90px;
font-size:42px;
color:#22c55e;
">
✉
</div>

</td>
</tr>





<!-- CONTENT -->
<tr>
<td align="center" style="
padding:20px 45px;
">


<h2 style="
margin:0;
font-size:24px;
color:#ffffff;
">
Verify your email, {{name}} 👋
</h2>



<p style="
margin-top:20px;
font-size:15px;
line-height:24px;
color:#9ca3af;
">

Welcome to Rentora!

To complete your registration and activate your account, please enter the verification code below.

</p>




<!-- CODE BOX -->

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="
margin-top:25px;
">

<tr>
<td align="center">


<div style="
display:inline-block;
padding:18px 40px;
background:#1f2937;
border-radius:14px;
border:1px solid #374151;
font-size:32px;
font-weight:800;
letter-spacing:8px;
color:#22c55e;
">

{{code}}

</div>


</td>
</tr>

</table>





<p style="
margin-top:20px;
font-size:13px;
color:#64748b;
">

This verification code will expire soon.
Please do not share this code with anyone.

</p>



</td>
</tr>







<!-- SECURITY CARD -->

<tr>
<td style="padding:20px 40px;">


<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="
background:#1f2937;
border-radius:12px;
">

<tr>
<td style="
padding:20px;
text-align:center;
">


<p style="
margin:0;
font-size:15px;
font-weight:700;
color:white;
">
🔐 Account Security
</p>



<p style="
margin:10px 0 0;
font-size:13px;
line-height:20px;
color:#9ca3af;
">

If you did not create a Rentora account, you can safely ignore this email.

</p>


</td>
</tr>

</table>


</td>
</tr>







<!-- CONTACT -->

<tr>
<td align="center" style="
padding:25px;
border-top:1px solid #1f2937;
">


<p style="
margin:0 0 15px;
font-size:12px;
color:#64748b;
letter-spacing:1px;
">
NEED HELP?
</p>




<a href="https://t.me/Vov_Markosyan"
style="
display:inline-block;
margin:5px;
padding:10px 18px;
background:#229ED9;
border-radius:10px;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:13px;
font-weight:600;
">
Telegram
</a>




<a href="https://www.instagram.com/vov_markosyann/"
style="
display:inline-block;
margin:5px;
padding:10px 18px;
background:#E1306C;
border-radius:10px;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:13px;
font-weight:600;
">
Instagram
</a>



</td>
</tr>








<!-- FOOTER -->

<tr>
<td align="center" style="
padding:20px;
background:#0f172a;
">


<p style="
margin:0;
font-size:12px;
color:#64748b;
">
© {{year}} Rentora
</p>


<p style="
margin:8px 0 0;
font-size:11px;
color:#475569;
">
Find • Buy • Sell Real Estate
</p>


</td>
</tr>



</table>


</td>
</tr>
</table>


</body>
</html>